# ─── FlowBoard — frontend environment ────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Cloud / Team mode is OPTIONAL.
#   • Leave BOTH blank  → local single-user mode (board stored in localStorage,
#                         no login required). Great for trying it out.
#   • Set BOTH          → team mode: login, Supabase persistence, multiple
#                         boards, workspaces, invites, and realtime multiplayer.
#
# Find these in your Supabase project → Settings → API.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
